<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Zuperming · Access Denied</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #000000;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 50%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4), transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 30%, rgba(69, 10, 10, 0.4), transparent 30%);
            color: #f1f5f9;
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(to right, #1e293b 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, #1e293b 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
            opacity: 0.15;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .zp-auth-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            background: rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.65);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(150%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .zp-auth-brand-logo {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .zp-auth-brand-logo::before {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            background: #ef4444;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .zp-error-code {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: #ef4444;
            line-height: 1;
            margin: 0 0 1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
        }

        .zp-auth-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .zp-auth-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin: 0 0 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .zp-auth-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #0f172a;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .zp-auth-btn:hover {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .zp-auth-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="zp-auth-wrapper">
        <div class="zp-auth-brand-logo">ZUPERMING</div>
        <div class="zp-error-code">403</div>
        <h1 class="zp-auth-title">Access Restricted</h1>
        <p class="zp-auth-subtitle">Your credentials do not meet the minimum clearance level required to access this system instance. Developer or Owner authorization is required.</p>
        <a href="/admin/login" class="zp-auth-btn">Return to Portal</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
